      "title": "tests: fix test fails on Ubuntu, fix #17730",
      "message": "tests: fix test fails on Ubuntu, fix #17730\n\nunset the env variable XDG_CONFIG_HOME in ubuntu.yaml (action config file), wireshark will use $HOME evn variable;\nand i test those two solutions, all test case is success;\n",
      "author_name": "easonweii",
      "author_email": "sharkhw@huawei.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-11-17T22:00:17.000+08:00",
      "committer_name": "easonweii",
      "committer_email": "sharkhw@huawei.com",
